[node name="Strongbox" type="Area2D" parent="Furniture"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(300, -150)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("8_story_item")
interaction_name = "Open the Strongbox"
flag_to_set = "duplicate_tiles_found"
discovery_text = "[b]Gregor's strongbox[/b]

Under the end of the counter, bolted to the boards, a merchant's strongbox. The lock has been worked open before and closed again with care. Beneath the coin tray is a cloth bundle.

Iron tiles. A whole second set of lot tiles, the same grey iron as the chapel's, the same square letters, Bjorn's hammer and pine on every back. Not every name in the village: a choice of them, the ones a man could palm in a year when the draw needed to fall somewhere. Several are worn smooth at the edges, as if they had been carried in a sleeve.

There is a gap in the bundle where one tile used to lie."
reexamine_text = "A second set of lot tiles in the chapel's iron, palm-worn. One is missing."

