[node name="MedicineShelf" type="Area2D" parent="Furniture"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-380, -150)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("8_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at Elena's Medicines"
flag_to_set = "white_salt_found"
discovery_text = "[b]Elena's medicine shelf[/b]

A low shelf kept apart from the stock, cleaner than the rest of the shop. Fever-root, bundled and dated. A honey crock. A cup with a rim of dried brown tea.

Behind the crock, a paper packet folded like an apothecary's, though no apothecary in the valley folds them this way. Inside is a white mineral salt, fine as flour, that bites the tongue. Enough for a month, if a pinch goes into the root-tea each night.

There is white dust in the cup's rim, too. Someone has been drinking this for a long time."
reexamine_text = "Fever-root, honey, and a packet of white salt no apothecary in the valley sells."

